    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/07454b143553f716c487b834532646a0.poster.avif?t=1746992140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/07454b143553f716c487b834532646a0.webm?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/07454b143553f716c487b834532646a0.mp4?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the World of the Abyss! </h2>A place where the darkest fears and painful memories come to life before your very eyes. Get ready to be pulled into a unique and thrilling adventure, where you'll have to team up with other brave adventurers to face your worst nightmares and overcome your deepest traumas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/5cf4bd6ebeba6995dbd900759a2fadca.avif?t=1746992140\" /></div><br><br>In Farewell, you'll immerse yourself in a dark and mysterious world, where your cooperative skills will be put to the test at every step of the way controlling 3 different characters. Will you find the courage to face your worst fears and memories? Only you can discover that!<br><br>Are you ready to join this exciting and challenging adventure? Then get ready to explore a world full of dangers and uncover the darkest secrets of your own fears and desires. Farewell awaits you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/c6c41353456ef437229ea02e682302c3.avif?t=1746992140\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/b799d094bdc6183a3aff0f54d05e082f.poster.avif?t=1746992140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/b799d094bdc6183a3aff0f54d05e082f.webm?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/b799d094bdc6183a3aff0f54d05e082f.mp4?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An JRPG where each character has a unique aiming attack with its own complexity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/9d47123f6363ec475aae82b956bf3285.poster.avif?t=1746992140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/9d47123f6363ec475aae82b956bf3285.webm?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/9d47123f6363ec475aae82b956bf3285.mp4?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> A system of emotions that will affect the characters, the gameplay and their actions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/1dc167d48de6ec610c246617425aef89.poster.avif?t=1746992140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/1dc167d48de6ec610c246617425aef89.webm?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/1dc167d48de6ec610c246617425aef89.mp4?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Unique interactions with each skill and each character. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/de16911ada47b96fbb236907052c269e.poster.avif?t=1746992140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/de16911ada47b96fbb236907052c269e.webm?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/de16911ada47b96fbb236907052c269e.mp4?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Organic dialogues based on your decisions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/39369787b2a0e061ab451fab1311f9aa.poster.avif?t=1746992140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/39369787b2a0e061ab451fab1311f9aa.webm?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167210/extras/39369787b2a0e061ab451fab1311f9aa.mp4?t=1746992140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> An unique original soundtrack.</li></ul>",
